          "sha256": "2e4bc58435b593a7034c62aab278358698529d250b0b1c2600085ce23a61bc1e",
          "quote": "77002 This Chapter contains basic guidance on SPC and explains\n\n\n1. the conditions of entitlement for SPC\n\n\n2. how to establish membership of the same household\n\n\n3. how to calculate the normal amount of SPC payable.\n\n\n77003 For guidance on\n\n\n1. the additional amounts of GC that may be awarded - see DMG Chapter 78\n\n\n2. the special rules that apply when calculating how much SPC to pay\n\n\n        2.1 to members of polygamous marriages - see DMG Chapter 78\n\n\n        2.2 to prisoners - see DMG Chapter 78\n\n\n        2.3 to members of religious orders - see DMG Chapter 78\n\n\n        2.4 when people are in hospital - see DMG Chapter 78\n\n\n        2.5 when people are subject to the loss of benefit provisions - see ADM Chapter B2\n\n\n        2.6 when people are absent from GB - see DMG Chapters 07 and 78\n\n\n3. payment questions - see DMG Chapter 79\n",
          "source_url": "https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=3"
        }
      ],
