          "sha256": "87086b2bd8ef19eb010957a9204936cb4186fff3b9f5b1e513fc069c98728c94",
          "quote": "Please note: As stated in the October 2019 DMG amendment package we are no\nlonger providing amendment packages (‘remove & insert pages’) for each DMG\nVolume. This summary of changes document does, however, inform the user of the\nsignificant changes that have taken place in each amended chapter by volume. The\npage footers on each page also continue to show the volume, amendment number\nand date.\n\nFrom June 2020 page footers will no longer appear. This is because the DMG\nchapters on GOV.UK will be produced from the Department’s ‘Intranet version’ of the\nDMG. This is an internet based product and as such there are no ‘book’ pages and\nassociated footers.\n",
          "source_url": "https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5fbf8c53e90e077ee4aace2b/adm-amends-summary-february-2020.pdf#page=1"
        }
