          "sha256": "3f658e16806ca81ca95dee6a7d1a6c6e7a4cfc0dfda288e8f71b7d472e2e4054",
          "quote": "From June 2020 page footers will no longer appear. This is because the DMG\nchapters on GOV.UK will be produced from the Department’s ‘Intranet version’ of the\nDMG. This is an internet based product and as such there are no ‘book’ pages and\nassociated footers.\n",
          "source_url": "https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5fbf8c53e90e077ee4aace2b/adm-amends-summary-february-2020.pdf#page=1"
        },
        {
          "document_key": "dmg:dmg-vol1-amendment61",
          "page": 1,
          "start_utf8": 456,
          "end_utf8": 774,
          "sha256": "a8bac59b5781ccfdeed9443732bf46be32ee3a93ebc395e1a34257a09e41ae39",
          "quote": "Please note that DMG volume amendment packages (‘remove & insert pages’) are\nno longer produced. This summary of changes document does, however, inform the\nuser of the significant changes that have taken place in each amended chapter by\nvolume. Page footers continue to show the volume, amendment number and date.\n",
          "source_url": "https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5eda534fe90e071b72b79dc8/dmg-amends-summary-for-june-2020.pdf#page=1"
        }
      ],
      "legal_effect": "not-established",
      "unknowns": [
        "The two frozen statements differ; this guide does not adjudicate the historical change or assume either statement applies to every captured document.",
        "A footer date is not automatically a legal commencement date."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/manual-guide/convention/change-log-incorporation-and-withdrawal",
      "category": "memos-and-updates",
      "statement": "The DMG Volume 1 change summary records corrections, additions and removal of references to a memo; it includes dated entries and chapter-specific changes.",
      "reading_implication": "Use change summaries as source-linked update candidates. Incorporation/removal statements need exact scope and dates; they do not by themselves establish a complete temporal model.",
      "assertion_status": "project-authored-source-linked",
      "confidence": "direct-source-statement",
      "scope": {
        "application": "cited-documents-and-excerpts-only",
        "document_keys": [
          "dmg:dmg-vol1-changes"
        ]
      },
      "source_support": [
        {
          "document_key": "dmg:dmg-vol1-changes",
          "page": 1,
          "start_utf8": 0,
          "end_utf8": 1335,
          "sha256": "d85c9728bca461dfd5e855fa4bb8c3fa1a97abc4ac0893ad4950e3b4601bacf2",
          "quote": "DMG - Volume 1: Decision making and appeals\nChapters 01-06\n\nSummary of changes from October 2020\n\nJuly 2026\nAnnexes A to M\n“Scottish disability or Carer benefit” added to the list of relevant benefits at Annex A.\n\nChapter 2\n“Scottish disability or carer benefit” included at para. 02264\n\n\nDMG Memo 3-26: AA, CA, DLA (Care Component) - Competent State for Cash\nSickness Benefits of Pensioners and their Family Members\nFurther amendments to the SE memo\n\nJune 2026\nParagraph 02706 incorrect paragraph number corrected.\nTypo in paragraph 02709.\nParagraph 03296 deleted duplicate word.\nParagraphs 06692-06694 Additional paragraphs included to reflect the Upper Tribunal\n(Administrative Appeals Chamber): Open Justice Practice Guidance - Courts and Tribunals\nJudiciary practice direction that all appeals will now not be anonymised.\n\n\nMay 2026\nChapters 02, 03 and 04\n\nAll references to DMG memo 03-25 have been removed. DMG Memo 03-25 is now\nremoved.\n\n\nFebruary 2025\nChapter 06 new insertions -\n\nRedaction\n\n06295 In general, evidence provided to the FtT should be submitted in its original,\nunredacted form. The names of decision makers, assessors, examiners, and\nwitnesses of fact or opinion must always be included in the response to the appeal1.\nSubject to DMG 06296, if the DM considers that all or part of a document should not\n",
          "source_url": "https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a68d9684dda8076771a427d/dmg-v-1-summary-of-changes.pdf#page=1"
        }
      ],
      "legal_effect": "not-established",
      "unknowns": [
        "This observation does not establish a general grammar, current legal applicability or complete dependency closure."
      ]
    },
